        'name': 'Teammate',
        'params': {'jsPath': 'agents/js/main.js'},
      }));
}

/// Reads all zip entry names.
List<String> zipNames(File zipFile) {
  final archive = ZipDecoder().decodeBytes(zipFile.readAsBytesSync());
  return archive.files.map((f) => f.name).toList();
}

